VITE_ARC_RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.arc.io
ARC_BLOCK_EXPLORER_URL=https://explorer.arc.io
VITE_ARC_BLOCK_EXPLORER_URL=https://explorer.arc.io

# Arc Smart Contracts (LaunchpadV2FactoryArc & LiquidityLocker)
